        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ivers Riley\n- Organizations: The Irish Stock Exchange, Citrix Systems\n- Companies: Euronext, Citrix Systems, an American multinational financial services corporation\n- Roles: Chairman\n- Topics: Corporate ownership, customer base\n\nFacts:\n- Ivers Riley served as chairman of the Irish Stock Exchange from June 2002 to 2006.\n- The Irish Stock Exchange is a wholly owned subsidiary of Euronext.\n- Euronext is an American multinational financial services corporation.\n- The parent company of the Irish Stock Exchange and Citrix Systems do not serve the same customer base.",
